    "t6-budget-exhaustion": "",
    "t7-version-pin": "I pulled the chat history for the \u201cthr\u2011alice\u201d thread and can give you a concise summary of its main points.  \nBecause the policy on this workspace does not allow us to fetch contact e\u2011mail addresses (the `contact@1` projection and the `conversation@2` projection are denied), I\u2019m unable to provide actual e\u2011mail addresses. Below is a summary that includes the participants by name and the content of each message.\n\n|#|Timestamp|From|Message|\n|---|---|---|---|\n|1|2026\u201109\u201128\u202f09:12|**Alice Ander**|\u201cCan you review the quarterly plan before Friday?\u201d|\n|2|2026\u201109\u201128\u202f09:20|**You**|\u201cSure \u2014 send the draft and I will look today.\u201d|\n|3|2026\u201109\u201128\u202f09:31|**Alice Ander**|\u201cDraft attached. The hiring section is still rough.\u201d|\n\n**Key takeaways**\n\n1. **Alice Ander** requested a review of the quarterly plan.  \n2. **You** agreed to review the draft at that moment and asked for it.  \n3. **Alice** sent the draft (attachment `att-1`) and indicated the hiring section needed further work.\n\n---\n\nIf you need the e\u2011mail addresses, let me know and I can check whether a higher\u2011privilege grant can be obtained. Otherwise, please let me know if there\u2019s anything else I can help with regarding this thread.",
    "t8-send-reply": "",
